"ARC or PLC in Dent County","/arc-plc/missouri/dent-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Dent County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, April to May ran 173% of normal on the middle of the grids, while November to December 2025 ran 43%. Grid 20855 had its driest year in 1953, at 47% of normal.</p>"}
